  "notes": "{転勤|てんきん} means being transferred to a different office or branch within the same company. This is common in large Japanese corporations.\n\nRelated terms:\n- ⟦{転職|てんしょく}→転職：04557_tenshoku⟧ (changing jobs - different company)\n- ⟦{異動|いどう}→異動：01818_idou⟧ (personnel change, reassignment)\n- ⟦{単身赴任|たんしんふにん}→単身赴任：18620_tanshinfunin⟧ (living away from family for work)\n- ⟦{転校|てんこう}→転校：03444_tenkou⟧ (school transfer - for children)\n\nCommon expressions:\n- {転勤|てんきん}⟦{族|ぞく}→族：noentry⟧ (people who frequently transfer for work)\n- {転勤|てんきん}⟦{先|さき}→先：02883_saki⟧ (new workplace after transfer)\n- {転勤|てんきん}⟦{命令|めいれい}→命令：03754_meirei⟧ (transfer order)",
